i>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 28px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 27.9221%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Sub inspector (Communication)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.0779%; height: 28px; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong data-end=\"207\" data-start=\"105\">Bachelor\u2019s Degree in Electronics, Information Technology (IT), Computer Science, or related fields</strong> from a recognized university.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 153px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 27.9221%; text-align: center; height: 153px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Assistant Sub Inspector ASI (Radiographer)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.0779%; height: 153px; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have <strong data-end=\"106\" data-start=\"52\">passed 12th (Intermediate) from a recognized board</strong>. They should also possess a <strong data-end=\"200\" data-start=\"135\">two-year Diploma in Medical Imaging Technology or Radiography</strong>, along with <strong data-end=\"329\" data-start=\"213\">at least one year of experience as a Radiographer in a radiology imaging center or a minimum 100-bedded hospital</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 153px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 27.9221%; text-align: center; height: 153px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Assistant Sub Inspector ASI (Pharmacist)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.0779%; height: 153px; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have <strong data-end=\"106\" data-start=\"52\">passed 12th (Intermediate) from a recognized board</strong>. They should also possess a <strong data-end=\"235\" data-start=\"135\">two-year Diploma in Pharmacy and must be registered as a Pharmacist under the Pharmacy Act, 1948</strong>, along with <strong data-end=\"360\" data-start=\"248\">at least one year of experience as a Pharmacist in a minimum 100-bedded hospital or a recognized institution</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 153px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 27.9221%; text-align: center; height: 153px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Assistant Sub Inspector ASI (Operation Theater Technician)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.0779%; height: 153px; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have <strong data-end=\"106\" data-start=\"52\">passed 12th (Intermediate) from a recognized board</strong>. They should also possess a <strong data-end=\"200\" data-start=\"135\">two-year Diploma in Operation Theatre Technology / Technician</strong>, along with <strong data-end=\"334\" data-start=\"213\">at least one year of work experience as an OT Technician in a minimum 100-bedded hospital or a recognized institution</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 153px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 27.9221%; text-align: center; height: 153px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Assistant Sub Inspector ASI (Dental Technician)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 72.0779%; height: 153px; text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have <strong data-end=\"106\" data-start=\"52\">passed 12th (Intermediate) from a recognized board</strong>. They should also possess a <strong data-end=\"231\" data-start=\"135\">two-year Diploma in Dental Hygienist and must be registered with the Dental Council of India</strong>, along with <strong data-end=\"355\" data-start=\"244\">at least one year of work experience in a dental unit of a dental hospital or a minimum 100-bedded hospital</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check : </span></strong><strong><a hr