s-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> What is the age limit for <strong>SSB SI / ASI Non-GD</strong><strong>\u00a0Bharti 2026</strong>?</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The age limit for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>SSB SI / ASI Non-GD</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>\u00a0Bharti 2026</strong></span>\u00a0is as follows:</span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 14pt;\">The minimum age is <strong>18</strong>\u00a0and the maximum age is <strong>27 \u2013 30 years <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Post Wise</span> as on SSB Rules.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the eligibility for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>SSB SI / ASI Non-GD</strong></span>\u00a0<strong>Vacancy 2026</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Answer: </strong>Candidates must have passed the <strong>10+2 Intermediate</strong> exam from any recognized board in India. For full eligibility details, please check the official notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt